{"id":2253,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为丰富校园心理文化生活，缓解同学们学业与生活压力，引导大家正视情绪、提升协作能力，2026年5月27日下午，心缘坊学生会参与举办心理游园会，以趣味互动为同学们搭建释放压力、治愈心灵的平台。</p><p>活动前期，学生会成员提前布置场地、备齐道具、规划流程，精心营造轻松温暖的游园氛围，保障活动有序开展。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMRGTYLmGYMlnkMt77bMmnVUlCZLzrjfnRLYLzV7L8CDnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVL1y8MYhVoR78MlLZLz9iUlQ2M4WfMl-sn7C4nRQ2olMFLNMRnzMRMzTFLzGZn7LJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YLmCJqdwnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11226&e=.jpeg\" thumb=\"tdocs://document/807d8d0f-06d4-52fa-984c-d78a4e3d1e9e/media/image/5872EE3B214A30FD4EB335B54BB7FA91CE1F6ACE.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8E247E8145C8185AFF72A5B7DF3D6F9C/2CCE3C59/108DC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 382px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMRGTYLmGYMlnkMt77bMmnVUlCZLzrjfnRLYLzV7L8CDnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVL1y8MYhVoR78MlLZLz9iUlQ2M4WfMl-sn7C4nRQ2olMFLNMRnzMRMzTFLzGZn7LJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YLmCJqdwnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11226&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次游园会设置三大心理互动项目。“闪闪发光的自己”环节中，同学们领取卡片写下个人高光事迹，可留下展示或自行带走，在回顾成长中肯定自我、增强自信。“和所有的烦恼说拜拜”环节备受欢迎，大家在气球上写下烦心事，吹鼓后踩爆，以趣味方式宣泄负面情绪，卸下心理包袱。“纸杯金字塔”考验团队默契，同学们组队用皮筋协作搭建三层纸杯金字塔，在互帮互助中增进情谊，感受合作的魅力。游园会现场氛围热闹温馨，同学们积极参与各项活动，在轻松玩乐中舒缓身心、收获成长。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLNWTfL4W7nzGiLtz62nN-iLmr2M4QjVLlV7nzvYL4V2o7L0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMSysn1ybn7Q7nN7YLR-aMz-8MzQVnzVVnRV7nmARUmWFo7lZoRGYU4rFMmlPU4UJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-YM1bw62w8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11226&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A157F9DFDFA202052456EE1ED1DF8CB2/8E8802C5/651C4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 656px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLNWTfL4W7nzGiLtz62nN-iLmr2M4QjVLlV7nzvYL4V2o7L0gihFp2hmCIa0USyPMSysn1ybn7Q7nN7YLR-aMz-8MzQVnzVVnRV7nmARUmWFo7lZoRGYU4rFMmlPU4UJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLz-YM1bw62w8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11226&e=.png\"></p><p>本次525心理游园会将心理疏导与趣味游戏相结合，为同学们心理健康充电。未来，心缘坊学生会将继续举办各类心理活动，守护同学心灵成长，助力大家以阳光心态从容面对学业与生活。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;中北大学环境与安全工程学院</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2026年5月27日</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hjaq.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NMRGTYLmGYMlnkMt77bMmnVUlCZLzrjfnRLYLzV7L8CDnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVL1y8MYhVoR78MlLZLz9iUlQ2M4WfMl-sn7C4nRQ2olMFLNMRnzMRMzTFLzGZn7LJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7YLmCJqdwnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11226&e=.jpeg"}